<!-- ====================  ABOUT CONTENT ==================== -->
<section class="container py-5">
  <div class="row g-5">
    <div class="col-lg-8">
      <span class="section-badge"><i class="fas fa-hospital me-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>Our Story</span>
      <h2 class="fw-bold mb-4">Welcome to Maccare Superspeciality Hospital</h2>
      <p class="mb-3">It is indeed a great privilege for us to present MACCARE Super-speciality Hospital in this historical city of Ahmednagar.</p>
      <p class="mb-3">We offer a blend of finest medical and surgical skills for maximum healthcare with compassion and patient centric approach, within the reach of everyone.</p>
      <p class="mb-3">Ours is the only multidisciplinary consortium providing comprehensive healthcare services with full-time super-specialists trained at nation's premier institutes. It's hub for tertiary health care services in Neurosurgery, Joint Replacements, Urology, Oncology, Diabetology, Trauma care apart from routine medical and surgical specialities.</p>
      <p class="mb-4">The system is backed by state of art Operation Theaters (First in the REGION) with high end Patient Monitoring Systems.</p>
      
      <h3 class="fw-bold mt-5 mb-3">Our Mission</h3>
      <ul class="list-unstyled mission-list">
        <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-2 mission-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> To ensure accessible and affordable medical treatment</li>
        <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-2 mission-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> To cultivate an environment of trust, mutual respect, and ethics amongst all sections of the health services</li>
        <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-2 mission-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> To be Center Of Excellence in Medical Research with emphasis on evidence based Medical practice</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h3 class="fw-bold mt-5 mb-3">Our Vision</h3>
      <p>To evolve as a benchmark as quality healthcare service provider available to one and all. Evidence based medicine is our motto. Your health is our passion and healing is our aim.</p>
      <p class="fst-italic">At Maccare, we will not just add years to life, but life to years as well.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="col-lg-4">
      <div class="about-sidebar">
        <div class="sidebar-card mb-4">
          <h4 class="mb-3">Hospital History</h4>
          <img src="img/h.jpeg" alt="Hospital History" class="img-fluid rounded-4 mb-3">
          <p>Founded in Ahmednagar with a mission to provide world-class healthcare to the community. Today we stand as a beacon of hope with state-of-the-art facilities.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="sidebar-card">
